r rationale for it and can't think of a better option. I don't want to block this work due to my hesitation since it is most likely a result of my lack of familiarity with the ShaderContainer code. \n\nSo to move this forward I suggest that we merge this as-is. Then, when Dario is back from vacation, I will ask him to take a look as well and point out if there are any potential issues, or perhaps a better way to avoid the duplication that neither of us are seeing. ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111976#pullrequestreview-3386753013","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111976","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-28T05:35:30Z"},{"id":3387569727,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7J6jY_","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"97c17aedc7d2c77fe5e2be55e2567842380865f6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111976#pullrequestreview-3387569727","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111976","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-28T09:16:21Z"}]